                },
                {
                  "title": "Text",
                  "body": "## Proposal Metadata\n- Number: OFF-2026-S132\n- Customer: CASCADES PISCATAWAY\n- Plant: Piscataway Plant\n- Country: USA\n- Language: es\n- Currency: EUR\n- Duration: 12 months\n- Validity Days: 45\n- Payment Terms: 50% upon order, 50% upon first visit"
